        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2503] The receiver shall ensure that the authenticated decryption function used to decrypt data can take an authentication tag (also known as \"tag\" for short) of 128 bits as the second input. Refer to 5.2.2 of NIST Special Publication 800-38D for further details.",
            "block_bbox": [
